Speech_0001L=Jung-Uh... Shing?
Speech_0002L=Yeah, what is... ah!
Speech_0003L=I found out what that beeping sound was...
Speech_0004L=Is it... is it a dud?
Speech_0005L=I don't know...
Speech_0006L=Check it...
Speech_0007L=You check it.
Speech_0008L=Okay...
Speech_0009L=Easy...
Speech_0010L=Take cover!
Speech_0011L=I want my mom...
Speech_0012L=We're still alive...
Speech_0013L=Easy...
Speech_0014L=Look... let's just bake that patrol data into the UAV and get out of here before it does go off.
Speech_0015L=Good idea.

