[P_09_SeoulTwo_HQcom]
Speech_0002L=LAMBERT - Fisher... I hate to do this to you... but we can't extract you yet.
Speech_0025L=FISHER - You're lucky I'm not unionized...overtime would come out to double and a half.
Speech_0020L=LAMBERT - We lost contact with the EA-6B before they could purge the data. It's still in the wreckage.
Speech_0021L=FISHER - So I have to go there and delete it?
Speech_0023L=LAMBERT - Before the North Koreans get their hands on it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0047L=LAMBERT - Fisher, the plane went down before they could purge the data. You need to get to the wreckage and make sure the North Korean's don't recover it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0182L=REDDING - NK regulars are setting up Portable Radar Reconnaissance Receivers. See if you can take them all out.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0183L=REDDING - Sam, it would be helpful if you could recover technical specification on these new North Korean UAV's.
Speech_0184L=FISHER - You bet.
Note_0168L=IFV's can be destroyed by lobbing a grenade in an open hatch.


Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0073L=REDDING - We have multiple reports of more active armor in your immediate A.O.
Speech_0074L=FISHER - Great.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0162L=REDDING - Good job, Fisher...you've seriously impaired North Korea's armored advance.
Speech_0081L=REDDING - Good job, Fisher...you've seriously impaired North Korea's armored advance.
Speech_0163L=REDDING - My god, Sam... how many of those things have you taken out today?
Speech_0164L=FISHER - I lost count.
Speech_0165L=REDDING - You're reducing a North Korean mechanized division to scrap metal.
Speech_0166L=FISHER - And I cost less than a single thousand pound bomb.
Speech_0167L=REDDING - Only if you don't count the cost of your life insurance policy. That's almost half our budget.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0017L=REDDING - Good job Sam. RF monitoring indicates at least four more P3R's active in your A.O.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0107L=REDDING - Sam, we have RF confirmation that there are only two P3R's left in your area.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0109L=REDDING - One more P3R to go, Fisher.
Speech_0110L=FISHER - I'll find it...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0018L=REDDING - Way to go, Sam. With those P3R's out of commission it'll be a lot safer to extract you.
Speech_0111L=FISHER - Wow... you mean you're actually planning to get me out of here alive one day?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0114L=REDDING - Fisher, it looks like you just bypassed one of the P3R's. There's no way back... you might as well forget the objective.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0112L=REDDING - That was the last P3R, Sam. Good job.
Speech_0113L=REDDING - NK regulars are setting up Portable Radar Reconnaissance Receivers. See if you can take them all out.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0120L=REDDING - Whoa... good grab, Sam. Looks like complete technical specification on North Korean UAV's.
Speech_0123L=FISHER - So, what, we can just switch them all off now?
Speech_0124L=REDDING - Ha. No. But we can pass it up the chain and inside of a few months find ways to disable them...
Speech_0125L=FISHER - Well, that's not much help to me then, is it.
Speech_0126L=REDDING - Sam, it would be helpful if you could recover technical specification on these new North Korean UAV's.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0096L=LAMBERT - Sam... get back to the building. You can designate the wreckage with your EEV from there.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0097L=LAMBERT - Sam... you need to designate the--
Speech_0098L=FISHER - No point in rescuing one and leaving the other.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0106L=LAMBERT - Sam, you need to get to the plane and try to recover that data before we can extract you.
Note_0161L=The pilots will be safe from the air strike in the side alley.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0129L=LAMBERT - Fisher... if you compromise this mission for those men...
Speech_0130L=FISHER - Save it Irving... you gave me my orders already.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0133L=LAMBERT - Forget him, Fisher. He's dead.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0134L=LAMBERT - Alright Fisher, good job. He should be safe from the blast. Designate the wreckage with your EEV.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0135L=LAMBERT - You don't even exist, Fisher... you can't get a medal for this.
Speech_0136L=FISHER - Medals don't help me sleep at night, Lambert.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0137L=LAMBERT - Alright, the pilots are safe, already. Now take out that plane.
Speech_0138L=FISHER - With pleasure.
POPUPMESSAGE_0171=Tap a Mobile Command Center
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0127L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher, there's another Mobile Command Center up ahead. This might be your last opportunity to tap into one. 
Speech_0128L=FISHER - Those Predator drones are busy little bees, aren't they.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0115L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good job Sam. Never hurts to have another line into the NKA command network.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good job, Sam. With an inside line on the NKA's command network we should be able to funnel useful intelligence to the reg's.
Speech_0066L=FISHER - Always happy to lend a hand.
POPUPMESSAGE_0172=Tap a Mobile Command Center
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0067L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I hate to be a pain, Fisher, but I really need you to tap that MCC before you go any further.
Speech_0068L=FISHER - I'll double back.
Speech_0069L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher, you need to tap the MCC before we'll be able to extract you.
Speech_0070L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good job, Sam. With an inside line on the NKA's command network we should be able to funnel useful intelligence to the reg's.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0175L=LAMBERT - Sweet Jesus Fisher...what did you do?
Speech_0176L=FISHER - It was an accident.
Speech_0177L=LAMBERT - We don't have room for accidents. Watch your fire.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0178L=LAMBERT - Dammit Fisher...that's the second civilian you've killed.
Speech_0179L=FISHER - Lambert...I...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0180L=LAMBERT - You should be able to designate the wreckage with your EEV from the top of this structure.
Speech_0181L=FISHER - Alright.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0185L=FISHER - God forgive me. 
Speech_0186L=LAMBERT - Alright, Fisher, you have an F-117 inbound...standby.
Speech_0187L=FISHER - Roger. Target is painted.
Speech_0188L=US_PILOT - Hello there paperboy. This is postman. We have your glare. Stay on target.
Speech_0189L=FISHER - Affirmative, postman.
Speech_0147L=US_PILOT - And... there you go paperboy. The package is in the mail.
Speech_0148L=FISHER - Confirm visual on the package postman.
Speech_0149L=US_PILOT - Have a better one. Postman out. 

