[P_09_SeoulTwo_Imprison_Com]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Fine! Okay! 
Speech_0002L=Shut up!
Speech_0003L=I surrender. I surrender. Just... please don't hurt me
Speech_0006L=You be quiet now! You're under arrest now!
Speech_0007L=Okay.
Speech_0010L=You're my prisoner!
Speech_0011L=Okay. I surrender.
Speech_0012L=Good... now don't move.
Speech_0013L=Okay.
Speech_0014L=Okay.
Speech_0015L=Now what do we do?
Speech_0016L=I don't know. You sit there... I'll figure something out.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Bae]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you doing here?
Speech_0002L=Ah! Oh... just my luck...
Speech_0003L=What are you talking about?
Speech_0004L=Sitting in there, minding my own business and 'crash'. 
Speech_0005L=What happened?
Speech_0006L=You crazy maniacs drop a giant bomb on my head.
Speech_0007L=Bomb?
Speech_0008L=The one in there! Went right through the room! Just missed me!
Speech_0009L=It didn't explode?
Speech_0010L=Not yet... doesn't matter now... you're probably going to kill me anyway...
Speech_0011L=I knew I should have stayed in bed.
Speech_0012L=Fine... do you worst...

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Bo]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Stay calm and you'll live...
Speech_0002L=Wh... who--
Speech_0003L=What unit are you with?
Speech_0004L=We're the second wave... we're here to reinforce the first battalion and secure the area.
Speech_0005L=Reinforcements? You must pack some supplies and extra equipment...
Speech_0006L=Our resupply kit. We carry some NATO 5.56 by 45 in there, in case we recover American rifles.
Speech_0009L=I found that already... anything else?
Speech_0010L=No... we travel light... the third wave will be better equipped.
Speech_0014L=Thanks for the tip.
Note_0015L=There is ammo beside the P3R on the office roof.
Speech_0011L=That's all we have... I swear...
Speech_0013L=Look out for bombs...

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Chen]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you doing here?
Speech_0002L=Thank god, you're American.
Speech_0003L=I'm not here to rescue you.
Speech_0004L=Please... I want to help you.
Speech_0005L=Too dangerous. Just tell me what you know.
Speech_0006L=The MCC up ahead... they have some kind of flying drone protecting them.
Speech_0007L=Thanks.
Speech_0008L=Be careful... I called for a mortar strike on the alley by the MCC before I was captured... it could come any second.
Speech_0009L=I'll be careful.
Speech_0010L=We are brothers in arms.
Speech_0011L=I am on your side.
Speech_0012L=I think there are snipers around.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_interog_chung]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=You ever think of calling roadside assistance?
Speech_0002L=Ah! Hey... let me go you American pig!
Speech_0003L=I'm just trying to be helpful.
Speech_0004L=You make jokes about your fancy capitalist style... living like kings on the backs of my people... take your roadside assistance and shove it up your--
Speech_0005L=Calm down, or I'll knock you down.
Speech_0006L=Do your worst.
Speech_0007L=Intelligence first.
Speech_0008L=There is an armored vehicle moving to secure the next street. How's that for intelligence! Ha! I hope it kills you.
Speech_0009L=I don't like you.
Speech_0010L=It's mutual.
Speech_0011L=Yeah... but I'm the one with the knife.
Speech_0012L=I hate you, pig.
Speech_0013L=You smell like milk and cookies.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Ho]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you doing here?
Speech_0002L=Ah! Who... uh... I'm... I just dropped off a some men to help secure the area.
Speech_0003L=How many men?
Speech_0004L=A sniper who went into the building... another guard to protect the MCC... and half a squad to scout ahead to the crash site.
Speech_0005L=How long until they reach the plane?
Speech_0006L=I don't know... they have orders to overlook... wait for an IFV to support them.
Speech_0007L=How long until the IFV arrives?
Speech_0008L=It should be any minute.
Speech_0010L=I surrender.
Speech_0011L=I'm just the driver.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Jin]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What are you doing here?
Speech_0002L=Ah! Wait... you're American... I am South Korean... we're allies!
Speech_0003L=I can see that from the uniform, what are you doing here.
Speech_0004L=I'm the advance scout for my unit... they're not far behind... 
Speech_0005L=How many?
Speech_0006L=Four more... allies... allies... we're badly reduced... can you help us?
Speech_0007L=I'm afraid I'm a little busy.
Speech_0008L=Who are you?
Speech_0009L=I'm the guy you never saw.
Speech_0011L=Please, we're allies...
Speech_0012L=If you don't let me tell my unit, they won't know you're on our side...

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Manchu]

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Pong]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Nice perch you have here. Where's your spotter?
Speech_0002L=Ah! Uh... he... he's dead.
Speech_0005L=Tell me something interesting, or you'll be reunited very shortly...
Speech_0006L=Uh... uh... you must be after the plane that crashed...
Speech_0007L=Maybe...
Speech_0008L=Out the other side of this building... down the street, left into the alley and over the wall... you can't miss it.
Speech_0009L=Thanks for the directions...
Speech_0010L=Be careful. A QRF is heading to the crash site.
Speech_0012L=I promise, I won't shoot you.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Seung]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Nice truck.
Speech_0002L=You can have it... the keys are over the visor.
Speech_0003L=Wouldn't be very subtle to start driving around here.
Speech_0004L=It also wouldn't be subtle to kill me...
