Speech_0007L=And...
Speech_0008L=He thinks they're still alive...
Speech_0009L=Alive?!
Speech_0010L=Yes... command told him to hold fire... they may be arranging to capture them.
Speech_0012L=This war is terrible.
Speech_0013L=I never wanted to hurt anyone.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Shing]
Note_0016L=There is a medical kit in the basement of the restaurant.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Boo.
Speech_0002L=Oh... no... please... be quiet... you might set off the bomb.
Speech_0003L=Tell me what I want to know and I'll let you leave.
Speech_0004L=Anything... I just want to get out of here before--
Speech_0005L=Do you have any equipment or supplies?
Speech_0006L=There's some medical supplies in the basement I think...
Speech_0007L=Thanks.
Speech_0008L=And we have the UAV command unit in the kitchen.
Speech_0009L=Interesting. You've been very helpful.
Speech_0010L=I'm very scared of that bomb.
Speech_0011L=Well, if it goes off, you won't notice.
Speech_0012L=Please, don't leave me near that bomb.
Speech_0013L=I'm scared of giant explosions.

[P_09_SeoulTwo_Interog_Yuan]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Quiet... I won't hurt you.
Speech_0002L=I'm not afraid of pain.
Speech_0003L=Maybe you haven't been properly introduced...
Speech_0004L=Ow... my wrist... arhghh... okay...
Speech_0005L=Tell me something interesting...
Speech_0006L=I'm just supposed to make sure the roof is clear while the guys up top set up the P3R.
Speech_0007L=You're not doing a very good job.
Speech_0008L=You're right... why don't you let me get back to work.
Speech_0009L=I don't know anything else.
Speech_0010L=Ask the other guys... I'm just a private.

