Speech_0011L=LAMBERT - What's the situation, Sam?
Speech_0012L=FISHER - The plane is smashed... I don't think I can recover the data. But two of the crew are alive... looks like they crawled out of the wreckage.
Speech_0013L=LAMBERT - If you can't recover the data, we need to make sure no one can. Fall back to a safe distance to designate the target. I'll get on the horn with Flight Ops on the Reagan.
