Speech_0017L=LAMBERT - I'm telling you what the objective is. I'm trusting you to complete it. You have your orders.
Speech_0018L=LAMBERT - The plane is too badly damaged to recover the data. You need to fall back and designate the target for an air-strike. Use the structure down the street for your platform.
