[P_09_SeoulTwo_MasterController]
Note_0028L=Do not kill any South Korean Troops
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Meanwhile, as the first horrifying numbers for this tragic conflict begin to roll in, Americans are asking,'How did this happen?'. It's a question we'll ask of Secretary of Defense Frank Mason, tonight on WNM Flash when White House correspondent Montgomery Lewis sits down with the Secretary to talk about the war, the contracting scandal, and his alleged affair with Air Force Major Veronique Guilbault.
Speech_0002L=In sports news, New York pitcher Akira Watanabe formally requested exemption from his contract with his new team. The world's highest paid baseball player has announced his intention to return to his country to join the Japanese Self Defense Force to 'quote' help defend his people, his land, and his culture from the Korean aggressors.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=The Chinese rocket is away!
Speech_0004L=What rocket?
Speech_0005L=The one being sent to rescue the stranded astronauts.
Speech_0006L=What stranded astronauts?
Speech_0007L=The ones on the ISS...
Speech_0008L=I haven't heard about that... what happened?
Speech_0009L=What do you mean you haven't heard? It's the biggest news story of the decade...
Speech_0010L=Have you not noticed that we are in the middle of a war?
Speech_0011L=Wars happen all the time... this is important.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0013L=Wow... your combat boots are really shiny.
Speech_0014L=They're new.
Speech_0015L=What? How did you get new combat boots?
Speech_0016L=I took them off a dead American.
Speech_0017L=What?! That's horrible.
Speech_0018L=Mine were worn out... and the army wasn't due to issue me a new pair until next year.
Speech_0019L=But... you took a dead mans boots... that must be bad luck or something...
Speech_0020L=Bad luck for him, I guess.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0026L=Come and get me you bastards!
Speech_0027L=You'll never take me alive!

